{"title":"Legend of the Emperor","synopsis":"Sejak Raja Zhou naik takhta, ia terobsesi dengan kecantikan Ratu Daji yang mempesona, memungut pajak yang berat dan menindas rakyat. Namun suatu hari, binatang suci Dinasti Shang, Naga Kura-kura, tiba-tiba mati, dan perebutan takhta resmi dimulai! Nantikan kelanjutannya hanya di Soulscans.my.id\n\nAlkisah di suatu dinasti yang rajanya hari-hari cuma hohohihe, tidak peduli dengan rakyatnya. Akhirnya MC lahir dan menjadi malapetaka bagi raja tersebut.","alternative_title":"天子传奇【重制版】","author":"拾部","artist":"拾部","genres":["Action","Drama","Fantasy","Historical","Martial Arts","Seinen","Supernatural"],"chapters":[{"id":"6a498cb6-3c10-4f71-a105-8b04226dbe2e","number":"50","title":"Chapter 50","date":"2026-07-31","images":[]},{"id":"520e45d1-9512-4a50-8b25-b664974e85a4","number":"49","title":"Chapter 49","date":"2026-07-31","images":[]},{"id":"2339017f-e6a6-473c-9834-11d1d5d0437a","number":"48","title":"Chapter 48","date":"2026-07-31","images":[]},{"id":"8a61f86c-b7f7-4e74-b0cf-ed3256aa4aed","number":"47","title":"Chapter 47","date":"2026-06-30","images":[]},{"id":"cb4ed084-f6b4-4d58-9a64-bddf5df528ff","number":"46","title":"Chapter 46","date":"2026-06-30","images":[]},{"id":"02954835-bebb-42ef-a4ec-08ab14515d00","number":"45","title":"Chapter 45","date":"2026-06-30","images":[]},{"id":"e6cba47c-3e6a-46ad-a4a3-a4f8dae9fdad","number":"44","title":"Chapter 44","date":"2026-06-30","images":[]},{"id":"ed08d04d-bc18-44ca-ac1d-c3646e323b84","number":"43","title":"Chapter 43","date":"2026-06-30","images":[]},{"id":"c12817e9-35fc-4fac-83b7-30d716c7503f","number":"42","title":"Chapter 42","date":"2026-06-30","images":[]},{"id":"79383e61-aa4c-46bd-bf2e-3df678fcbbc8","number":"41","title":"Chapter 41","date":"2026-06-30","images":[]},{"id":"63078649-4f0d-4f7e-9bba-f6dc8aa5a959","number":"40","title":"Chapter 40","date":"2026-06-28","images":[]},{"id":"9a960970-a335-48ee-983b-d9d0e20d0c34","number":"39","title":"Chapter 39","date":"2026-06